{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261115/photo/bkn-20261115013724941-1115_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261115015929\"/><p>兩的士車頭嚴重損毀。</p><p>旺角發生交通意外。今日(15日)凌晨1時26分，兩輛的士分別駛至洗衣街與弼街交界發生碰撞，途經駕駛人士懷疑司機被困車內，代為報案。救援人員到場將傷者救出，意外中，據報有4人受傷。涉事兩的士車頭嚴重損毀，警員正調查意外起因。受事件影響，洗衣街往太子道西方向受阻。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T18:08:56.051616+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T17:37:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T18:42:40.511460+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T18:02:10.814603+00:00","content_hash":"687505ee0edfeb7d60e8a2c63d1618acdb598b85337eecb0f24cdd9928ba507a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}